OL,4,CIncrease in direct cremations since    
OL,5,Cpandemic                               
OL,6,GFuneral directors say there has been   
OL,7,Gan increase in direct cremations, with 
OL,8,Gno mourners in attendance, since the   
OL,9,GCovid-19 pandemic.                     
OL,11,FBrian Ugalde, whose firm of funeral    
OL,12,Fdirectors has worked in Cornwall for   
OL,13,F135 years, said non-attendance had     
OL,14,Fbecome more acceptable since the       
OL,15,Flockdowns when families were not       
OL,16,Falways allowed to attend.              
